Created hello. Run it: cd hello && kepler do run
[project]
name = "hello"

[tasks.run]
file = "main.kp"
print("Hello from hello")
> kepler run main.kp
Hello from hello
hello already exists.
exit 1
A project name holds letters, digits, - and _, not a/b.
exit 2
usage: kepler run [--allow LIST] [--limit LIST] [--watch] [--debugger FILE] [--no-spec] file.kp [args...]
       kepler test [path] [--no-spec]
       kepler do [task]
       kepler new name
       kepler doc [name]
       kepler version
exit 2
